The '''Accessory Bag''' is a [[Bag]] that allows players to store [[Accessories]]. While in the Accessory Bag, stored Accessories will grant {{MP}}, which grants [[Maxwell#Stats Tuning|Tuning Points]] that can be used to optimize players' [[Stats]] to their liking.

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

== Obtaining ==
'''Accessory Bag''' can be accessed through the [[Bags]] section of the [[SkyBlock Menu]] and can be increased through various ways. {{Green|9}} '''Accessory Bag''' slots are unlocked for everyone. 

=== Redstone Collection ===
{{Main|Redstone Dust}}
The '''Accessory Bag''' increases in size through the {{Item|Redstone Dust}} collection, the collection gives a maximum of {{Green|48}} slots.
