=== Redstone Miner ===
{{Main|Redstone Miner}}
At the {{Zone|Pigmen's Den}}, the {{NPCSprite|Redstone Miner}} requests some {{Item|Redstone Dust}} in exchange for a total of {{Green|4}} slots.

=== Community Center ===
{{Main|Elizabeth}}
In the {{Zone|Community Center}}, the Accessory Bag can be further expanded through [[Account & Profile Upgrades|Account Upgrades]], up to {{Green|12}} slots in the accessory bag. 
