=== Jacobus ===
{{Main|Jacobus}}
{{NPCSprite|Jacobus}} sells {{Green|2}} slots per purchase in exchange for {{c}}, up to {{Green|198}} slots in the accessory bag.

=== Attributes ===
{{Main|Attributes}}
The {{Attr|Accessory Size}} [[Attribute]], which is obtained from syphoning the {{Item|Hideonring Shard}}, adds {{Green|1}} slot per level, up to {{Green|10}} slots in the accessory bag.

== Usage ==
{{See also|Accessory Power|Accessory Powers|Power Stones}}

The Accessory Bag can hold any [[Accessories]] and [[Hatcessories]] within it.

Within the Accessory Bag, the effects of Accessories will apply to the player, including its [[Accessory Power]].

