== Trivia ==
*The '''Accessory Bag''' was called the '''Talisman Bag''' prior to Update 0.13, which introduced {{MP}}. It is still called {{Code|talisman_bag}} in the [[SkyBlock API]].
*Unlocking the Greater Accessory Bag upgrade grants the {{Ach|Accessories Galore}} achievement.
*Certain counters, such as the {{Item|Beastmaster Crest}} counter, do not show properly within the Accessory Bag; requirements to use certain accessories such as [[Slayer]] accessories will also show as if the player has not reached them. However, their stats and effects will still work.
*It costs {{c|1.7615b}} to reach the maximum upgrade at [[Jacobus]].

